      "summary": "10 tests ran; 3 failed: native panel item installation, committed API NBT lag, and PG board branch lookup.",
      "correction": "Add the native CEE attachment item tag; publish consumed committed API results; query the native baked PG board branch rather than an empty per-component branch list.",
      "resolution_status": "corrective_change_implemented; final_frozen_acceptance_required",
