      "summary": "20 tests ran; 6 failed: 4 custom CEE model cases, the AC current oracle, and actual API chunk unloading.",
      "correction": "Dispatch CEE registrations on mod event buses before freeze; include actual native wire resistance in the AC equation; place concurrent forced/unload fixtures beyond each other's ticket radius.",
      "resolution_status": "corrective_change_implemented; final_frozen_acceptance_required",
      "backend": "JAVA"
    },
    {
      "log": "build/api-registration-java.log",
      "run": "run/api-registration-java",
      "kind": "packaged_fixture_failures",
      "summary": "8 tests ran; 2 failed. Custom CEE registration, callback rollback/recovery and native PG board assembly passed. Remaining failures concerned the removal-to-discharge time window and native replacement load voltage.",
      "correction": "Anchor the twenty-tick discharge window after the safe topology boundary and assert exact history increments; calculate replacement load voltage with its native resistance and both wires.",
      "resolution_status": "corrective_change_implemented; final_frozen_acceptance_required",
      "backend": "JAVA"
    },
    {
