      "summary": "The bounded actual-unload diagnostic aborted with chunk ticket level 39 after 420 server ticks.",
      "correction": "A concurrently forced cold-restart fixture eight chunks away retained the unload fixture through its propagated generation ticket. Move the two fixtures at least sixteen chunks apart.",
      "resolution_status": "corrective_change_implemented; final_frozen_acceptance_required",
      "backend": "JAVA"
    },
